# Exclude offline Blender CAD files and bulky non-runtime artifacts from
# the Vercel Serverless Function bundle (250 MB unzipped limit).
# All files remain tracked in Git for local engineering and pytest.

# Only exclude the ROOT offline CAD source directory.
# Unanchored assets/ also excluded public/assets/phantom-a10.glb on Vercel.
/assets/
archive/
refs/
scratch/
tests/
tools/
engineering/
docs/*
!docs/phantom/
results/
evidence/*.tar.gz
evidence/*.zip
evidence/raymond-flight-two/*.jsonl
evidence/flights/*/events.jsonl
evidence/flights/*/events.jsonl.gz
evidence/flights/*/model.xml
evidence/source/assembly_repairs*.json
evidence/source/native_inventory.json
evidence/r6_clearance_audit.json
evidence/argon_task01_transmission_tanks.json
# Recorded mobile flight archives are GitHub evidence, not Vercel runtime files.
evidence/phantom/mobile_flights_20261104/
# Research stills, wing-cassette videos, design-sweep dumps and visual-regression
# captures are GitHub evidence. No server code or page reads them; together they
# pushed the Python function past Vercel's 225 MB bundle ceiling.
evidence/phantom/media/
